        {"zh": "那块肉看上去很好吃。", "en": "That meat looks tasty."},
        {"zh": "靠近点，这附近有吃的。", "en": "Come closer, there's food nearby."},
        {"zh": "闻到食物的味道，忍不住。", "en": "Can't resist the food's scent."},
        {"zh": "寻找下一餐，目标明确。", "en": "Seeking the next meal, focused."},
